    "detailed_description": "&quot;Hospital Hospitality&quot; is a 3D adventure &quot;find and click&quot; game. In a world engulfed in chaos and destruction, you find yourself at the center of an exciting adventure with &quot;Hospital Hospitality.&quot; <br />\r\nAn abandoned hospital, full of secrets and horrors, becomes the arena for your heroism. Here, survival is not enough \u2014 you must save the life of your friend who is in critical condition. <br />\r\nHow do you summon the strength and resourcefulness at this moment?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore the grim corridors and abandoned wards. Every movement brings a new discovery: a mysterious note, a forgotten medication. <br />\r\nThe sense of unease grows with every door you open!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExploration<br />\r\nAtmospheric sound and graphics<br />\r\nEngaging location<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Hospital Hospitality&quot; is not just a game; it\u2019s a true test for you.<br />\r\n Will you be able to explore these sinister spaces, gather the necessary supplies, and save your friend? Every move could be crucial.",
